    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Tue, Dec 10, 2013 at 2:21 PM, Aakash Chand <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">aakash...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Tareef,<div><br></div><div>I am able to deploy the apps successfully when I included library(RCurl), library(RJSONIO) inside server.R and ui.R</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div>I am just wondering, why do I need to include these libraries for deploying the app, since runApp() doesn&#39;t require me to add these libraries.</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you so much.<br></div>\r\n<div>\r\nAakash</div><div><div><div><br>On Tuesday, December 10, 2013 8:38:06 AM UTC-8, Aakash Chand wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<font><font color=\"#000000\">When I fire deployApp(), I am getting the error message as: </font><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.333333969116211px;line-height:16.666667938232422px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><i><b><font color=\"#ff0000\">Error: Unhandled Exception: Child Task 15518 error: Unhandled Exception: Missing dependency &#39;bitops&#39; for package &#39;caTools&#39;</font></b></i></span></font><div>\r\n\r\n<br></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;line-height:16.666667938232422px;white-space:pre-wrap\">I then installed </span><font face=\"Consolas, Lucida Console, monospace\"><span style=\"line-height:16.65625px;white-space:pre-wrap\">caTools, bitops, RCurl and RJSONIO packages and loaded them. But I am still getting the same error.</span></font></font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"Consolas, Lucida Console, monospace\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"line-height:16.65625px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Consolas, Lucida Console, monospace\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"line-height:16.65625px;white-space:pre-wrap\">Some additional info that may be of some help:</span></font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.333333969116211px;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16.666667938232422px;color:rgb(248,248,248);background-color:rgb(20,20,20);white-space:pre-wrap!important\">\r\n\r\nR version 3.0.2 (2013-09-25)\r\nPlatform: x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu (64-bit)</pre></div><div><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.333333969116211px;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16.666667938232422px;color:rgb(248,248,248);background-color:rgb(20,20,20);white-space:pre-wrap!important\">\r\n\r\nother attached packages:\r\n[1] shiny_0.8.0.99 caTools_1.16   shinyapps_0.2  RJSONIO_1.0-3  RCurl_1.95-4.1 bitops_1.0-6  \r\n\r\nloaded via a namespace (and not attached):\r\n[1] digest_0.6.4 httpuv_1.2.1 tools_3.0.2  xtable_1.7-1</pre></div><div><font face=\"Consolas, Lucida Console, monospace\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"line-height:16.65625px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></div><div>\r\n\r\n<font face=\"Consolas, Lucida Console, monospace\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"line-height:16.65625px;white-space:pre-wrap\">When I do runApp(), it works fine and doesn&#39;t require any of the above mentioned packages.</span></font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"Consolas, Lucida Console, monospace\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"line-height:16.65625px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Consolas, Lucida Console, monospace\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"line-height:16.65625px;white-space:pre-wrap\">It would be really great if somebody could assist me. This is the first app that I am trying to deploy and can&#39;t wait for the excitement.</span></font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"Consolas, Lucida Console, monospace\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"line-height:16.65625px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Consolas, Lucida Console, monospace\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"line-height:16.65625px;white-space:pre-wrap\">Thank you,</span></font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"Consolas, Lucida Console, monospace\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"line-height:16.65625px;white-space:pre-wrap\">Aakash</span></font></div></div></blockquote></div></div></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
